{
    "chapter_num": 3,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "All for Christ"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Finally, my brethren, rejoice in the Lord. For me to write the same things to you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " not tedious, but for you "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "it is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " safe."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beware of dogs, beware of evil workers, beware of the mutilation! "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For we are the circumcision, who worship "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU, M in the Spirit of God"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "God in the Spirit, rejoice in Christ Jesus, and have no confidence in the flesh, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "though I also might have confidence in the flesh. If anyone else thinks he may have confidence in the flesh, I more so: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "circumcised the eighth day, of the stock of Israel, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the tribe of Benjamin, a Hebrew of the Hebrews; concerning the law, a Pharisee; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "concerning zeal, persecuting the church; concerning the righteousness which is in the law, blameless."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But what things were gain to me, these I have counted loss for Christ. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet indeed I also count all things loss for the excellence of the knowledge of Christ Jesus my Lord, for whom I have suffered the loss of all things, and count them as rubbish, that I may gain Christ "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and be found in Him, not having my own righteousness, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " from the law, but that which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " through faith in Christ, the righteousness which is from God by faith; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that I may know Him and the power of His resurrection, and the fellowship of His sufferings, being conformed to His death, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "if, by any means, I may attain"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. arrive at"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the resurrection from the dead."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Pressing Toward the Goal"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Not that I have already attained,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "obtained it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " or am already perfected; but I press on, that I may lay hold of that for which Christ Jesus has also laid hold of me. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, I do not count myself to have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "laid hold of it"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "apprehended; but one thing "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I do,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " forgetting those things which are behind and reaching forward to those things which are ahead, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "I press toward the goal for the prize of the upward call of God in Christ Jesus."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore let us, as many as are mature, have this mind; and if in anything you think otherwise, God will reveal even this to you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Nevertheless, to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the degree"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " that we have already "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "arrived"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "attained, let us walk by the same "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits rule and the rest of v. 16."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "rule, let us be of the same mind."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Our Citizenship in Heaven"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Brethren, join in following my example, and note those who so walk, as you have us for a pattern. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For many walk, of whom I have told you often, and now tell you even weeping, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "that they are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the enemies of the cross of Christ: "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whose end "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " destruction, whose god "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is their"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " belly, and "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "whose"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " glory "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " in their shame—who set their mind on earthly things. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For our citizenship is in heaven, from which we also eagerly wait for the Savior, the Lord Jesus Christ, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "who will transform our lowly body that it may be conformed to His glorious body, according to the working by which He is able even to subdue all things to Himself."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}